;\n            } else {\n                out.append(\"\\n// failed to decompile: \").append(name).append('\\n');\n            }\n        }\n        decompiler.dispose();\n\n        Files.write(Paths.get(outputPath), out.toString().getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));\n        println(\"DecompileSome: wrote \" + ok + \"/\" + total + \" functions to \" + outputPath);\n    }\n}\n"}
